I walk along the canal.
There are wide stone steps here.
I look for a free spot.
I find a spot in the sun.
I sit down.
I drink my warm coffee.
Then I eat my cake.
The weather is fantastic now.
It is beautifully sunny and calm.
The sun shines on my face.
It is surprisingly warm.
I am really warm.
I unbutton my green coat.
Then I pull off my yellow hat.
I smile and look at the water.
It will not rain anymore today.
